{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Boom Buddy</strong> is a thrilling and nostalgic twist on the classic catapult game, blending childhood fun with modern gameplay mechanics. Get ready to load your launcher, take aim, and bring down hidden enemies cleverly tucked behind wooden beams and stone barricades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Precision is key as you analyze each trajectory to cause maximum destruction. With intuitive controls and satisfying physics, every shot feels impactful and rewarding. Whether you're a casual player or a strategic thinker, Boom Buddy delivers a dynamic challenge across more than 30 hand-crafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game\u2019s colorful characters and lively animations add charm to every moment, while power-ups and unique enemy types keep the gameplay fresh and engaging. Whether you're launching for fun or aiming for perfection, Boom Buddy promises hours of addictive entertainment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf Over 30 challenging levels to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 Smart aiming system with helpful trajectory guides</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd39\u200d\u2642\ufe0f A variety of quirky characters and clever obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca5 Power-ups that boost your blasting power</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to launch, smash, and conquer in <strong>Boom Buddy</strong> \u2013 the ultimate catapult showdown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630310?t=1743478281","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630310?t=1743478281","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630310/1d73be126244e4c7d1db7380bd5d786579ee6861/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743478281","c